@startuml
title FlightOS clockevent device flow
skinparam linetype ortho

start
:Architecture creates a timer device;
:Device advertises modes, limits, and callbacks;
:Generic clockevent layer validates the device;
if (watchdog capable?) then (yes)
  :Offer device to watchdog policy;
  if (accepted?) then (yes)
    :Select watchdog device;
  else (no)
    :Offer device to tick policy;
  endif
else (no)
  :Offer device to tick policy;
endif
if (accepted by tick policy?) then (yes)
  :Select per-CPU tick device;
  :Calibrate minimum effective tick period;
  :Configure periodic or one-shot operation;
else (no)
  :Leave device unused;
endif
stop
@enduml
